    "long_instructions": "Another major concern with AI is Algorithm bias. Watch the video below to learn more.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">📝 Key Points from the Video</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;\">\r\n    <p>\r\n\r\n* As AI's impact grows, its ethical considerations become increasingly crucial.\r\n* Disparities exist between those who create AI systems and those affected by them. Inclusive AI development should incorporate perspectives from vulnerable and marginalized groups.\r\n* Long-term societal goals should guide AI development to ensure beneficial outcomes.\r\n* AI can perpetuate societal biases found in training data, affecting decisions like home loans and criminal charges.\r\n* Democratizing AI technology is vital to ensure it benefits all segments of society.\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n"
  },
